OL,3,GNEWSAFitness coach had stroke weeks
OL,4,Aafter giving birth
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth and fitness coach Becki Barratt
OL,7,Fnever imagined she would hear the words
OL,8,F"you've had a stroke" at the age of 33.
OL,10,FBut just three weeks after welcoming
OL,11,Fher second child into the world, she
OL,12,Fhad suffered a stroke while
OL,13,Fbreastfeeding at home.
OL,15,FThis meant that instead of enjoying
OL,16,Fthose precious first weeks with her
OL,17,Fnewborn, she was navigating motherhood
OL,18,Fwhile living with left-sided paralysis.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
